OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm a lawyer by day, dhol drummer
OL,4,Aby night'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBy day, Sandi Kaur is a lawyer... by
OL,7,Fnight, she is a drummer in the UK's
OL,8,Ffirst and - they claim - only team of
OL,9,Fbhangra dhol players and dancers.
OL,11,FEternal Taal have performed at
OL,12,FGlastonbury, been in Hollywood films,
OL,13,Fappeared on The Graham Norton Show and
OL,14,Fmost recently took to the stage at The
OL,15,FEuropean Athletics Championships in the
OL,16,Fcity - but Kaur says, in some ways, her
OL,17,Ftwo "jobs" do not feel too dissimilar.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
