OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm a lawyer by day, dhol drummer
OL,4,Aby night'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"When you're in the legal field... it's
OL,7,Fthe meticulous attention to detail,
OL,8,Fit's clientele, but when I'm on these
OL,9,Fstages, I still feel these people are
OL,10,Fmy beautiful clients, and I'm doing
OL,11,Fthem a service - I'm providing
OL,12,Fsomething for them," she smiled.
OL,14,FKaur, from Wolverhampton, joined the
OL,15,FBirmingham-based group in 2019, and at
OL,16,Fher first performance, at Arts in the
OL,17,FPark in Sutton Coldfield, she said she
OL,18,Ffelt like "a baby swan being set loose
OL,19,Fin fresh lake waters".
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
